---
---

<div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-brand-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-950/60 via-slate-900 to-slate-950 p-8 sm:p-12 my-16 shadow-2xl shadow-brand-500/10">
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-brand-500/10 border border-brand-500/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-300 mb-4">
      <span>✉️ Boletín Semanal de Automatización</span>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
      Recibe 1 Flujo de n8n probado en producción cada semana
    </h2>
    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
      Únete a más de 2,500 operadores de agencias y tiendas online. Compartimos plantillas JSON descargables, comparativas de costos y tácticas para reducir horas operativas sin pagar Zapier.
    </p>

    <!-- Email Form -->
    <form class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 max-w-md mx-auto" action="#" method="POST" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('¡Gracias por suscribirte a AutoHub!');">
      <input
        type="email"
        placeholder="tu@agencia.com"
        required
        class="flex-grow rounded-xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-700 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-white placeholder-slate-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-500"
      />
      <button
        type="submit"
        class="rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-indigo-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:from-brand-500 hover:to-indigo-500 shadow-lg shadow-brand-600/30 transition-all hover:scale-[1.02]"
      >
        Suscribirme Gratis
      </button>
    </form>
    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-3">
      Cero spam. Desuscríbete con un clic en cualquier momento.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
